        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz, Jay T. Wright\n- Companies: Troma Entertainment\n- Works: The Toxic Avenger, Tromeo and Juliet, All the Love You Cannes!\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, actor\n- Concepts: narrative tension\n\nFacts:\n- Stanley Lloyd Kaufman, Jr. was born on December 30, 1945.\n- Lloyd Kaufman is an American film director, producer, screenwriter, and actor.\n- Lloyd Kaufman and producer Michael Herz co-founded Troma Entertainment.\n- Lloyd Kaufman directed many Troma Entertainment feature films, including The Toxic Avenger and Tromeo and Juliet.\n- All the Love You Cannes! is a 2002 documentary film directed by Lloyd Kaufman.\n- Jay T. Wright’s films often use tension as a competing motive and sometimes in direct conflict with narrative.",
